  "description": "Cross-product acceptance wall for the family vector-retrieval contract (ADR-0051 / plan 50 P0). Every vendored copy of contracts/vector_contract.py must satisfy these rows — score math, chunk aggregation, weighted RRF fusion, space-key stability and stored-key precedence, content-hash normalization, the v1 caps/defaults and the degradation vocabulary. Same law, one table, never per-repo edits.",
